A '''Team Skull Grunt''' (Japanese: '''スカルだんのしたっぱ''' ''Team Skull Underling'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VII]]. They are members of [[Team Skull]] who are dressed in punk attire, called Skull Tanks, and wear bandannas with a skull motif. New members are responsible for purchasing their own uniforms. The Grunts keep their Pokémon in [[Nest Ball]]s.

